"Apply online for an <b>e-Tourist Visa</b> — approval comes by email in a few days. Print it and bring it. Indian passport or OCI card? Skip this one.": "请在线申请<b>电子旅游签证 (e-Tourist Visa)</b>——几天内就会通过电子邮件获批。请打印出来随身携带。持印度护照或 OCI 卡？则无需办理。",
"⚠️ Apply only on the official Government of India website, <b>indianvisaonline.gov.in</b>. Look-alike sites charge several times the real fee.": "⚠️ 请只在印度政府官方网站 <b>indianvisaonline.gov.in</b> 申请。仿冒网站收取的费用是真实费用的好几倍。",
"Thiruvananthapuram has wonderful shops for Indian wear. Shop on your first day — alterations and blouse stitching usually take a day or two.": "特里凡得琅有很多出色的印度服饰店。建议抵达第一天就去购物——修改衣服和缝制纱丽上衣通常需要一两天。",
"Mumbai → Thiruvananthapuram (TRV). Several flights a day. The links open today's live flights and prices; change the dates to suit you.": "孟买 → 特里凡得琅 (TRV)。每天有多个航班。链接会打开今天的实时航班和票价，您可以按需更改日期。",
"The reception is on <b>Friday 15 January</b> and the wedding on <b>Saturday 16 January</b>. Choose the travel dates that suit you.": "婚宴招待会在<b>1月15日（周五）</b>，婚礼在<b>1月16日（周六）</b>。请选择适合您的出行日期。",
"We'd love to see the weekend through your eyes. Add your favourite photos and videos to our shared album — no account needed.": "我们很想透过您的眼睛，看看这个周末的点点滴滴。欢迎把您最喜欢的照片和视频上传到我们的共享相册——无需注册账号。",
"If you have a spare day before or after the celebrations, there's plenty to see, eat and shop for. A few of our favourites:": "如果您在庆典前后有一天空闲，这里有很多值得游览、品尝和选购的地方。以下是我们的一些心头好：",
"<b>Heat</b> — drink sealed bottled water, rest in the shade, and bring any medicines you need, with their prescriptions.": "<b>炎热天气</b>——请喝密封的瓶装水，多在阴凉处休息，并带上您需要的药物及其处方。",
"<b>Passport, cash and jewellery</b> — keep them in your hotel safe. Carry a photo or photocopy of your passport instead.": "<b>护照、现金和珠宝</b>——请存放在酒店保险箱里。外出时带上护照的照片或复印件即可。",
"<span class=\"rsvp-summary-label\">Flying in</span><span class=\"rsvp-summary-value\">Yes — from within India</span>": "<span class=\"rsvp-summary-label\">是否乘飞机前来</span><span class=\"rsvp-summary-value\">是 — 从印度国内出发</span>",
"<b>Manyavar</b> for men's sherwanis and kurtas, plus Biba, Jaypore and Ritu Kumar for women. Near the airport.": "<b>Manyavar</b> 有男士 sherwani（印度长礼服）和 kurta（印度长衫），女装可选 Biba、Jaypore 和 Ritu Kumar。靠近机场。",
"Please plan to arrive a little early: the ceremony begins at an auspicious moment and starts right on time.": "请稍微提早到场：仪式在吉时 (muhurtham) 开始，会准时进行。",
"Palms together with a small nod is a warm, respectful hello to elders. Handshakes are fine with friends.": "双手合十、微微点头，是向长辈表达亲切与尊重的问候方式。和朋友之间握手也没问题。",
"<span class=\"rsvp-summary-label\">WhatsApp</span><span class=\"rsvp-summary-value\">🇮🇳 +91 91234567</span>": "<span class=\"rsvp-summary-label\">WhatsApp</span><span class=\"rsvp-summary-value\">🇮🇳 +91 91234567</span>",
"India uses <b>230V</b> and plug types <b>C, D and M</b> (round pins). Bring a universal travel adapter.": "印度电压为<b>230V</b>，插头为<b>C、D 和 M</b> 型（圆脚）。请带上一个万能旅行转换插头。",
"The handloom village on the way to Kovalam, famous for cream-and-gold <b>kasavu</b> sarees and mundu.": "前往科瓦兰 (Kovalam) 途中的手工织布村，以米白配金色的 <b>kasavu</b>（白金织锦）纱丽和 mundu（传统围裹布）闻名。",
"<span class=\"rsvp-summary-label\">Dietary</span><span class=\"rsvp-summary-value\">Vegetarian</span>": "<span class=\"rsvp-summary-label\">饮食要求</span><span class=\"rsvp-summary-value\">素食</span>",
"<b>Tip:</b> shop on your first day — alterations and blouse stitching usually take a day or two.": "<b>小贴士：</b>建议抵达第一天就去购物——修改衣服和缝制纱丽上衣通常需要一两天。",
"<span class=\"rsvp-summary-label\">Events</span><span class=\"rsvp-summary-value\">Reception</span>": "<span class=\"rsvp-summary-label\">参加活动</span><span class=\"rsvp-summary-value\">婚宴招待会</span>",
"First time in Kerala? Here's everything to sort out, in order. Tap each one as you finish it.": "第一次来喀拉拉邦 (Kerala)？以下是需要依次办好的所有事项。每完成一项，就点一下它。",
"Pick your city to see today's flights and prices. You can change the dates on the next page.": "选择您的城市，查看今天的航班和票价。您可以在下一页更改日期。",
"<span class=\"rsvp-summary-label\">Party size</span><span class=\"rsvp-summary-value\">2</span>": "<span class=\"rsvp-summary-label\">人数</span><span class=\"rsvp-summary-value\">2</span>",
"A boat ride through mangroves to where the river meets the sea.": "乘船穿过红树林，前往河流与大海交汇之处。",
"Plus-ones are noted on your invitation. If you're unsure, just check with us directly.": "可携带的同伴人数已注明在您的请柬上。如有疑问，直接问我们就好。",
"The people, places, and practical details that will make the weekend feel effortless.": "让这个周末轻松自在的人、地方和实用信息，都在这里。",
"We are so thankful for your love and support. Having you there is what matters most.": "非常感谢您的爱与支持。您能到场，就是对我们最重要的。",
"<span class=\"cal-date\">15 Dec 2026</span>Last call: apply for your Indian e-Visa": "<span class=\"cal-date\">2026年12月15日</span>最后提醒：申请印度电子签证",
"<span class=\"cal-date\">1 Dec 2026</span>Wedding trip: book flights &amp; hotel": "<span class=\"cal-date\">2026年12月1日</span>婚礼行程：预订机票和酒店",
"<span class=\"cal-date\">13 Jan 2027</span>Fill in your India e-Arrival Card": "<span class=\"cal-date\">2027年1月13日</span>填写印度电子入境卡 (e-Arrival Card)",
"Absolutely. Note it in your RSVP and we'll make sure the kitchen knows.": "当然可以。请在回复中注明，我们会确保厨房知悉。",
"Please arrive 15 minutes before the ceremony to be seated comfortably.": "请在仪式开始前15分钟到场，以便从容入座。",
"<b>Meen curry</b>Kerala fish curry, tangy with kodampuli and coconut": "<b>Meen curry（鱼咖喱）</b>喀拉拉鱼咖喱，以 kodampuli（藤黄果）和椰子调味，酸香开胃",
"<b>Appam &amp; stew</b>Lacy rice pancakes with a mild coconut stew": "<b>Appam &amp; stew（蕾丝米饼配炖菜）</b>薄如蕾丝的米饼，配温和的椰奶炖菜",
"<span class=\"rsvp-cc-flag\">🇲🇾</span> Malaysia <strong>+60</strong>": "<span class=\"rsvp-cc-flag\">🇲🇾</span> 马来西亚 <strong>+60</strong>",
"<b>Sadya</b>A vegetarian feast of 20+ dishes on a banana leaf": "<b>Sadya（芭蕉叶素宴）</b>在芭蕉叶上享用的素食盛宴，多达20余道菜",
