"Fly into <a class=\"name-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Trivandrum+International+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Trivandrum International Airport (TRV)</b></a> — about 25 minutes by car from the venue. The celebrations begin with the reception on <b>Friday 15 January</b> and the wedding on <b>Saturday 16 January</b> — plan your arrival and departure however suits you. Direct flights: Singapore (Scoot), Kuala Lumpur (AirAsia, Malaysia Airlines), Colombo (SriLankan), and the Gulf. From Europe and the US, connect through Dubai, Doha, Abu Dhabi or Singapore. When you RSVP, you'll get a flight finder for your city. <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Trivandrum+International+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open in Google Maps →</a>": "请飞抵<a class=\"name-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Trivandrum+International+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>特里凡得琅国际机场 (Trivandrum International Airport, TRV)</b></a>——距婚礼场地约25分钟车程。庆典将于<b>1月15日（周五）</b>的婚宴拉开序幕，婚礼则在<b>1月16日（周六）</b>举行——抵达与离开的时间可随您方便安排。直飞航班：新加坡（Scoot）、吉隆坡（AirAsia、Malaysia Airlines）、科伦坡（SriLankan）以及海湾地区。从欧洲和美国出发，可经迪拜、多哈、阿布扎比或新加坡转机。回复出席（RSVP）后，您将获得适合您所在城市的航班查询工具。<a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Trivandrum+International+Airport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Google Maps 中打开 →</a>",
