"London → Thiruvananthapuram (TRV). No direct flight — usually one stop via Dubai, Doha or Abu Dhabi. The links open today's live flights and prices; change the dates to suit you.": "伦敦 → 特里凡得琅 (TRV)。没有直飞航班——通常经迪拜、多哈或阿布扎比转机一次。链接会显示当天的实时航班和票价；请按需要修改日期。",
"Tokyo → Thiruvananthapuram (TRV). No direct flight — usually one stop via Singapore or Kuala Lumpur. The links open today's live flights and prices; change the dates to suit you.": "东京 → 特里凡得琅 (TRV)。没有直飞航班——通常经新加坡或吉隆坡转机一次。链接会显示当天的实时航班和票价；请按需要修改日期。",
