"Kuala Lumpur → Thiruvananthapuram (TRV). Direct: AirAsia and Malaysia Airlines, about 4 hours. The links open today's live flights and prices; change the dates to suit you.": "吉隆坡 → 特里凡得琅 (TRV)。直飞：AirAsia 和 Malaysia Airlines，约4小时。链接会显示当天的实时航班和票价；请按需要修改日期。",
"<a class=\"name-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napier+Museum+Thiruvananthapuram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Napier Museum &amp; Zoo</a>": "<a class=\"name-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napier+Museum+Thiruvananthapuram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">纳皮尔博物馆及动物园 (Napier Museum &amp; Zoo)</a>",
