"<a class=\"name-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Pothys+MG+Road+Thiruvananthapuram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Pothys, MG Road</b></a> — a six-storey store with three floors of sarees, plus kurtas and ready-made outfits. <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Pothys+MG+Road+Thiruvananthapuram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open in Google Maps →</a>": "<a class=\"name-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Pothys+MG+Road+Thiruvananthapuram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Pothys, MG Road</b></a> — 六层大型商场，其中三层专营纱丽，另有库尔塔（kurta）和成衣。 <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Pothys+MG+Road+Thiruvananthapuram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Google Maps 中打开 →</a>",
