"<span class=\"travel-when\">Book with your flights</span> <strong>Hotel</strong> <!-- EDIT ME: replace with recommended hotels / room block once chosen --> <span>Book for whichever nights suit your plans. Our picks, all close to the reception:</span> <span class=\"travel-routes\"> <b>Hyatt Regency Trivandrum</b> — five-star, about 1 km<br> <b>Vivanta Thiruvananthapuram</b> (Taj) — five-star, about 2 km<br> <b>Hilton Garden Inn</b>, <b>Mascot Hotel</b>, <b>The South Park</b> or <b>Hycinth</b> — upper mid-range, about 1.5–2.5 km </span> <span class=\"travel-links\"> <a class=\"travel-btn travel-btn-ghost\" href=\"https://www.google.com/travel/search?q=Hyatt%20Regency%20Trivandrum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hyatt →</a> <a class=\"travel-btn travel-btn-ghost\" href=\"https://www.google.com/travel/search?q=Vivanta%20Thiruvananthapuram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vivanta →</a> <a class=\"travel-btn travel-btn-ghost\" href=\"https://www.google.com/travel/search?q=Hilton%20Garden%20Inn%20Trivandrum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hilton Garden Inn →</a> </span>": "<span class=\"travel-when\">与机票一同预订</span> <strong>酒店</strong> <!-- EDIT ME: replace with recommended hotels / room block once chosen --> <span>按您的行程选择入住日期即可。以下推荐酒店都靠近晚宴场地：</span> <span class=\"travel-routes\"> <b>Hyatt Regency Trivandrum</b> — 五星级，约1公里<br> <b>Vivanta Thiruvananthapuram</b> （Taj 泰姬集团）— 五星级，约2公里<br> <b>Hilton Garden Inn</b>、<b>Mascot Hotel</b>、<b>The South Park</b> 或 <b>Hycinth</b> — 中高档，约1.5–2.5公里 </span> <span class=\"travel-links\"> <a class=\"travel-btn travel-btn-ghost\" href=\"https://www.google.com/travel/search?q=Hyatt%20Regency%20Trivandrum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hyatt →</a> <a class=\"travel-btn travel-btn-ghost\" href=\"https://www.google.com/travel/search?q=Vivanta%20Thiruvananthapuram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vivanta →</a> <a class=\"travel-btn travel-btn-ghost\" href=\"https://www.google.com/travel/search?q=Hilton%20Garden%20Inn%20Trivandrum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hilton Garden Inn →</a> </span>",
"A graceful old heritage hotel run by Kerala Tourism, opposite the museum gardens, with a large pool.": "由喀拉拉邦旅游局经营的典雅老牌历史酒店，正对博物馆花园，设有大型泳池。",
"A long-standing city-centre favourite on MG Road, close to shops and restaurants.": "位于 MG Road 的市中心老字号酒店，邻近商店和餐厅。",
"Distances are approximate driving estimates to Trivandrum Club; allow extra time in evening traffic. All six are 15–25 minutes from the airport.": "以上距离为前往 Trivandrum Club 的大约车程，傍晚交通繁忙时请预留更多时间。六家酒店距机场均约15–25分钟车程。",
"Six hotels close to the reception at Trivandrum Club, so getting there is easy. Book early — mid-January is high season in Kerala.": "六家酒店都靠近晚宴场地 Trivandrum Club，往返十分方便。请尽早预订——一月中旬是喀拉拉邦的旅游旺季。",
"Five-star": "五星级",
"Five-star · Taj group": "五星级 · Taj 泰姬集团",
"Reliable international comfort near Palayam, with a rooftop pool and a good restaurant.": "位于 Palayam 附近，国际品牌，舒适可靠，设有屋顶泳池和不错的餐厅。",
"Taj's city hotel on C V Raman Pillai Road in Thycaud. Calm, polished and well located.": "Taj 泰姬集团旗下的城市酒店，位于 Thycaud 的 C V Raman Pillai Road。环境安静、精致，位置便利。",
"The closest to the reception, just down the road in Vazhuthacaud. Modern rooms, pool, spa and several restaurants.": "距离晚宴场地最近，就在 Vazhuthacaud 同一条路上。客房现代，设有泳池、水疗和多家餐厅。",
