"<b>Beef fry</b>Slow-roasted beef with coconut slivers and curry leaves — Kerala's most famous dish": "<b>炒牛肉（Beef fry）</b>与椰子片和咖喱叶慢炒的牛肉——喀拉拉邦最有名的菜",
"<b>Dosa (thosai)</b>Crisp rice-and-lentil crêpe with chutney and sambar": "<b>Dosa（印度煎饼 / thosai）</b>米和扁豆制成的薄脆煎饼，配酸辣酱和桑巴汤",
"<b>Malabar biryani</b>Fragrant short-grain rice layered with spiced chicken": "<b>马拉巴尔香饭（Malabar biryani）</b>香气扑鼻的短粒米与香料鸡肉层层叠放",
