"One last step — tap below to send your RSVP to us by email.": "最后一步——请点击下方按钮，通过电子邮件把回复发送给我们。",
"Send my RSVP by email": "通过电子邮件发送我的回复",
"@A Kerala wedding: the couple with their friends, the men in cream kurtas and mundus, the women in silk sarees and lehengas": "喀拉拉邦婚礼：新人与朋友们，男士身穿米色 kurta 和 mundu，女士身穿丝绸纱丽和 lehenga",
"Grihapravesham": "Grihapravesham（新娘入门礼）",
"Henna ceremony · Fri 15 Jan, morning": "指甲花彩绘仪式 · 1月15日（周五）上午",
"Celebration dinner · Fri 15 Jan, evening": "庆祝晚宴 · 1月15日（周五）晚上",
"Welcoming the bride into the groom's home · Sat 16 Jan": "迎接新娘进入新郎家 · 1月16日（周六）",
"Fri 15 January, morning": "1月15日（周五）上午",
"The henna ceremony — intricate designs are painted on the bride's hands, and guests are welcome to have a little henna too. Venue and time to be confirmed.": "指甲花彩绘仪式——新娘的双手会绘上精美的图案，宾客也欢迎画上一点指甲花。地点和时间待定。",
"<b>Wear:</b> bright colours, with short or loose sleeves so the henna can dry.": "<b>着装：</b>鲜艳色彩，穿短袖或宽松袖，方便指甲花晾干。",
"The bride is welcomed into the groom's family home for the first time, traditionally carrying a lit brass lamp (nilavilakku). Venue and time to be confirmed — please arrive a little early.": "新娘第一次被迎入新郎家中，传统上她会手捧一盏点亮的黄铜灯（nilavilakku）。地点和时间待定——请稍早到场。",
"Welcoming the bride into the groom's home. Venue and time to be confirmed — we'll share the details here and on WhatsApp as soon as they're set.": "迎接新娘进入新郎家。地点和时间待定——确定后我们会在这里和 WhatsApp 上通知大家。",
"The henna ceremony. Venue and time to be confirmed — we'll share the details here and on WhatsApp.": "指甲花彩绘仪式。地点和时间待定——我们会在这里和 WhatsApp 上通知大家。",
"We can't wait to introduce the friends and family standing with us on the day. Their names and photos are coming soon — check back closer to January.": "我们迫不及待想向大家介绍婚礼当天陪伴在我们身边的亲友。他们的名字和照片即将公布——请在一月临近时再来看看。",
"Reach out to Alok and Elaine at alokelaine@gmail.com": "联系 Alok 和 Elaine：alokelaine@gmail.com",
"What are the events?": "有哪些活动？",
"There are three: the <b>Mehendi</b> (henna ceremony) on the morning of Friday 15 January, the <b>Reception</b> at Trivandrum Club that evening, and the <b>Grihapravesham</b> — welcoming the bride into the groom's home — on Saturday 16 January. Times and the remaining venues will be confirmed soon. See <a href=\"#\" data-modal=\"modal-dress-code\" style=\"color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;\">Weekend &amp; Dress Code</a> for what happens at each.": "共有三场：1月15日（周五）上午的 <b>Mehendi</b>（指甲花彩绘仪式）、当晚在 Trivandrum Club 举行的<b>婚宴招待会</b>，以及1月16日（周六）的 <b>Grihapravesham</b>——迎接新娘进入新郎家。时间和其余场地将很快确认。每场活动的详情请见<a href=\"#\" data-modal=\"modal-dress-code\" style=\"color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;\">周末安排与着装</a>。",
"Colourful and festive — Indian wear is very welcome but never expected, and a smart dress or light suit is perfect too. Please avoid all-white and all-black, and leave bright red to the bride. See <a href=\"#\" data-modal=\"modal-dress-code\" style=\"color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;\">Weekend &amp; Dress Code</a> for outfit ideas for each event and where to shop in the city.": "色彩缤纷、喜庆即可——非常欢迎穿印度服装，但绝不强求；优雅的连衣裙或轻便西装也很合适。请避免全白和全黑，并把鲜红色留给新娘。各场活动的着装建议和市内购物地点请见<a href=\"#\" data-modal=\"modal-dress-code\" style=\"color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;\">周末安排与着装</a>。",
"What time should I arrive?": "我应该几点到达？",
"Please arrive about 15 minutes early for each event — the Grihapravesham begins at an auspicious moment and starts right on time. Times will be shared here and on WhatsApp once confirmed.": "每场活动请提前约15分钟到场——Grihapravesham 会在吉时开始，准时进行。时间确认后会在这里和 WhatsApp 上通知大家。",
"How do I get to the venues?": "怎么去各个场地？",
"We recommend Uber — it's safe and the price is fixed upfront. <b>Coming by car?</b> Trivandrum Club has parking on its grounds; it can fill up on a busy evening, so please arrive a little early. All six of our recommended hotels have guest parking too — just mention your car when you book. Addresses and maps are in Travel Logistics under <b>Getting around</b>.": "我们推荐使用 Uber——安全，价格事先确定。<b>自驾前来？</b>Trivandrum Club 院内设有停车场；晚间活动时车位可能较满，请稍早到达。我们推荐的六家酒店也都为住客提供停车位——预订时说明您会开车即可。地址和地图请见“旅行安排”中的<b>出行交通</b>。",
"Travelling from": "出发地点",
"Distances update for your hotel. Drive times are typical daytime traffic.": "距离会根据您选择的酒店自动更新。车程按白天一般交通情况估算。",
